:"每一粒沙子，都有它存在的价值。","hasText":true,"duration":3.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/117/06162648BE8B31000183137383039383434.mp3"},{"id":"06854648BE8B31000183237363234393932","heroId":"117","skinId":"799","skinName":"沙海飞舟","title":"戈娅_沙海飞舟_大厅语音3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"别眨眼，马上就到！","hasText":true,"duration":3.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/117/06854648BE8B31000183237363234393932.mp3"},{"id":"06157648BE8B31000183130323638383435","heroId":"117","skinId":"799","skinName":"沙海飞舟","title":"戈娅_沙海飞舟_移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"希望是值得等待的东西，虽然渺茫，但却很珍贵。","hasText":true,"duration":5.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/117/06157648BE8B31000183130323638383435.mp3"},{"id":"06800648BE8B21000183239303233373433","heroId":"117","skinId":"799","skinName":"沙海飞舟","title":"戈娅_沙海飞舟_大厅语音2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"风暴，必将如期而至！","hasText":true,"duration":13.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/117/06800648BE8B21000183239303233373433.mp3"},{"id":"06883648BE8B21000183236383536393732","heroId":"117","skinId":"799","skinName":"沙海飞舟","title":"戈娅_沙海飞舟_大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"狂沙席卷之处，皆为我的猎场！","hasText":true,"duration":13.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/117/06883648BE8B21000183236383536393732.mp3"}]